{"text": "Caperucita llegó con la canasta. Al acercarse a la cama, vio unas orejas peludas y unas patas enormes. La voz también sonaba extraña. Dio un paso atrás: aquella persona no parecía su abuela. Caperucita: Esa no es la voz de mi abuelita.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.847499, "from": 0, "to": 10}, {"start": 0.86225, "end": 1.216708, "from": 11, "to": 16}, {"start": 1.231458, "end": 1.393916, "from": 17, "to": 20}, {"start": 1.408708, "end": 1.497333, "from": 21, "to": 23}, {"start": 1.512083, "end": 2.147124, "from": 24, "to": 31}, {"start": 3.175208, "end": 3.396749, "from": 33, "to": 35}, {"start": 3.4115, "end": 4.090833, "from": 36, "to": 45}, {"start": 4.105625, "end": 4.135166, "from": 46, "to": 47}, {"start": 4.149916, "end": 4.253291, "from": 48, "to": 50}, {"start": 4.268083, "end": 4.666833, "from": 51, "to": 55}, {"start": 5.080333, "end": 5.242791, "from": 57, "to": 60}, {"start": 5.257541, "end": 5.582457, "from": 61, "to": 65}, {"start": 5.59725, "end": 6.040291, "from": 66, "to": 72}, {"start": 6.055041, "end": 6.675332, "from": 73, "to": 80}, {"start": 6.690083, "end": 6.808249, "from": 81, "to": 82}, {"start": 6.823, "end": 7.162666, "from": 83, "to": 87}, {"start": 7.177458, "end": 7.620499, "from": 88, "to": 93}, {"start": 7.635291, "end": 8.373707, "from": 94, "to": 101}, {"start": 9.392708, "end": 9.569916, "from": 103, "to": 105}, {"start": 9.584708, "end": 9.865291, "from": 106, "to": 109}, {"start": 9.880083, "end": 10.323124, "from": 110, "to": 117}, {"start": 10.337916, "end": 10.795749, "from": 118, "to": 124}, {"start": 10.8105, "end": 11.460291, "from": 125, "to": 132}, {"start": 12.479333, "end": 12.715624, "from": 134, "to": 137}, {"start": 12.730375, "end": 12.878041, "from": 138, "to": 140}, {"start": 12.892833, "end": 13.232499, "from": 141, "to": 145}, {"start": 13.247291, "end": 13.749416, "from": 146, "to": 151}, {"start": 14.044791, "end": 14.487832, "from": 153, "to": 160}, {"start": 14.502583, "end": 15.03424